mixin review
  .review
    .review__header  
      .review__avatar 
        img.review__avatar_image(src=require('@images/avatar-1.png') alt="avatar")
      .review__name-wrapper
        .review__name Мурад Сарафанов
        .review__date 5 дней назад
    .review__content 
      .like-button__item.like-button__item-favorite 
        span.material-icons.material-icons-favorite.like-icon favorite
        span.like-button__item_text 12
      .review__text Великолепный матрас на кровати в